<title>DUBAI: Dubai silver re-exports to India up in November.</title>
<headline>Dubai silver re-exports to India up in November.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Re-exports of silver from the Gulf Arab trading emirate of Dubai to India rose to 57.63 tonnes in November from 45.40 tonnes the previous month, statistics compiled from Dubai customs showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dubai is a major supplier of silver and gold to India which is the world's single largest consumer market.</p>
<p>Exports to Pakistan totalled 2.19 tonnes. --Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255</p>
</text>
